        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Time-bounded role where a person embodies a deity as Living Goddess (Kumari), residing at a specific god-house and supported by religious institutions. This class captures the unique Nepali tradition of living deity embodiment in young girls selected from Buddhist Shakya/Vajracharya families.</skos:definition>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/heritagegraph/schema"/>
    </owl:Class>
    


