        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A performed assessment carried out during Kumari selection. Modelled as an event (not a hard criterion) so that source-specific, possibly conflicting accounts of whether/how it was conducted attach as provenanced Assertions rather than being asserted as fact.</skos:definition>
